# Build context = an allowlist. The image needs only the application code, the
# pinned dependency lock and the licence files (see Dockerfile); everything else
# - tests, docs, scripts, the generated corpus, virtualenvs, git metadata and,
# above all, any local .env holding secrets - is excluded by default.
*
!app/
!requirements-lock.txt
!LICENSE
!NOTICE

# ...minus build artefacts that may sit inside app/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
